# .windsurfrules

### CRITICAL: Technology Stack Constraints
*   **Prohibited Tech:** MongoDB is strictly prohibited for core application, billing, user data, and authentication systems. Use PostgreSQL 16 and Redis for all core services. Deviations require a formal ADR. <!-- decispher:ids=393329ba-9640-498c-89f1-46c1324aaeff,a06bac38-381d-472f-852d-f902db9a70c4 -->
*   **Billing/Payments:** Revenue squad owns all billing/Stripe logic; PRs in these areas require their explicit approval. <!-- decispher:ids=43a78d92-5543-412c-9be3-00596ee8ce65 -->

### HIGH: Infrastructure & Architecture
*   **Orchestration:** Use AWS EKS for container orchestration; prioritize flexibility and multi-AZ failover. Billing service must run on long-running containers (avoid serverless to prevent cold-start latency). <!-- decispher:ids=add28e0b-7a4c-4b40-9679-0d488565bb4b,08631b5a-a39c-4766-b840-beb3a13fde5e -->
*   **Services:** Transition Azure Functions to full-scale backend services. Remove Stream Chat and Shipsy dependencies; build in-house equivalents. Migrate SMTP/Email to Zoho. <!-- decispher:ids=9f213a97-eb01-49b8-aa57-76b0a2358c10,e8a1dec8-3524-4365-a291-fba0b55b57a4,bd1748c1-766b-4f12-9819-536593b3c5ed,e9097831-0c7b-43f1-895a-b115dd36c20b -->
*   **LLM Integration:** Route all LLM calls through `GuardedProviderRegistry` (`wrapTextProvider`, `wrapEmbeddingProvider`) for cost tracking/kill-switches. Enforce provider fallback: Extraction (Anthropic→DeepSeek→OpenAI), Detection (Google→OpenAI→DeepSeek). <!-- decispher:ids=08702be0-9097-4015-89a9-6f3307cdd76c,ac87f0e5-a048-4197-a533-31b2a71ea5a8 -->
*   **API Standards:** Enforce RFC 7807 (Problem Details) for all error responses. Use camelCase JSON and TypeScript for new backend services. <!-- decispher:ids=d01a8dd8-f37c-406d-8050-d98eaab82da0,127df168-2a46-4b88-a207-e6887cc4183f,d17917ac-183e-43cf-b52a-894b44e7eb32,47baf067-44b5-4456-a34c-fce4360c84a3 -->
*   **Compliance:** Migrate SNMP to ITSI RFC (deprecate 3GPP). Enforce 5-minute auth token expiry. <!-- decispher:ids=b5692ce3-058f-4fff-b37c-f3a14d89d277,02e6acff-0e2b-4caf-969d-be906d20eedc -->

### MEDIUM: Data & Vector Operations
*   **Database:** Standardize on PostgreSQL with `pgvector` and HNSW indexes. Use cosine distance (`<=>`) for similarity. Use `text-embedding-3-small` (1536-dim). <!-- decispher:ids=81145171-98f5-43da-b922-9c76d78741b5,75490c8c-3a3d-4253-a8ff-9768e6359aaf,f2770524-250d-48f2-bf4c-ea54e9744ada,e1408395-0737-4115-a49b-e616d5227fe5,f3db51f2-6914-415f-9fca-78783563463d -->
*   **Deduplication:** Limit to same-type comparisons with 0.12 threshold. Use `fusion-eval` for tuning. <!-- decispher:ids=4407df70-f88d-4a6c-ad00-6109d8605f95,3ada5b02-0165-4c53-afe6-f5ac4f1e2823 -->
*   **MCP/Sessions:** Track sessions via Redis (`session_id` with 30m rolling TTL). Include `agent_type` enum in Redis and `mcp_logs`. <!-- decispher:ids=d01640f7-b859-4654-908c-7b5f263e92eb,a0fb66a4-0691-48c6-9245-5b023347648e,cfe6365d-63eb-4b8b-9164-f956524c984f -->
*   **Payment/Regions:** Migrate Indian payments from Stripe to Paddle. <!-- decispher:ids=dfba9327-9cf0-4f93-8348-6e51249a44e2 -->

### LOW: General
*   Navigation component styling: Use separate `navbar.scss`. Mobile communications: Use iPhones. <!-- decispher:ids=c8fa6892-aeb9-4617-b1d4-8f54a071667a,606e27a4-4b72-485e-94dd-7a2008e80874 -->